{"n": 20, "grade": "faithful", "reason": "\"The extraordinary pushforward, one of Grothendieck's six operations, in étale cohomology of schemes was constructed in SGA 4 XVII [6].\"", "doubt": true, "doubt_reason": "\"Constructed in\" a cited work may not be the same as introducing a term under the rubric's defines test."}
